N,G|               CLOSE ON POWELL, as if she is seeing the image of ALIA,            
N|               driving in silence for a while, lost in thought.                   
O|
N|               Then she snaps out of her reverie and taps the screen on her       
N|               car’s inboard computer. She selects ‘check messages’.              
O|
C|                                   COMPUTER VOICE                                 
U|                         You have one unheard message...                          
N|               Her husband’s voice comes on.                                      
O|
C,E|                                   SIMON (V.O.)                                   
U|                         Katherine, I want you to know that                       
U|                         I don’t appreciate your angry calls                      
U|                         first thing in the morning. Neither                      
U|                         do the boys want to be humiliated                        
U|                         in front of their girlfriends.                           
U|                         Robert is under a lot of stress                          
U|                         with his exams so you back off.                          
N|               This is just about the last thing she wants to hear. As she        
